@startuml 15-address-activity
title Address Activity (E4, task #23): AddressActivityService and AddressActivityEvaluator (D23-001 to D23-007)

skinparam shadowing false

start
:Attributions scored by confidence-1;
if (Confidence Level > 0?) then (no)
  :not in the outcome map
  report: NOT_CHECKED, addressActivity null (D23-002);
  stop
endif
:canonical address (network + address);
if (address in the synthetic fixture demo-v1-activity?) then (yes)
  :SyntheticActivitySource
  complete history, labelled "Dane testowe" (synthetic = true) (D23-007);
elseif (app.address-activity.live-enabled?) then (yes)
  :BTC: mempool.space /api/address/{a}, /txs
  ETH: Blockscout /api/v2/addresses/{a}/counters, /transactions, /token-transfers
  only the bare address leaves the application (D23-003);
  if (usable answer?) then (no)
    :UNAVAILABLE (never zero activity); <<#pink>>
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :UNAVAILABLE; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:AddressActivityEvaluator (D23-004)
totals: stated by the source, else summed when the history is complete, else unknown
first activity only when complete, last activity from the newest transfer;
:cash-out signals (D23-006)
* OUT to a counterparty labelled EXCHANGE in the offline lists (kind from its tags: remitano P2P,
  wirex CRYPTO_CARD, fiat-gateway PAYMENT_GATEWAY, else EXCHANGE, D23-010), or labelled by the fixture: any amount
* swap into USDT / USDC / DAI (by contract) of at least 1000 units
sorted by time;
:coverage limitations
RECENT_TRANSACTIONS_ONLY, LABELLED_COUNTERPARTIES_ONLY, INTERNAL_TRANSFERS_NOT_COUNTED (ETH live);
:AVAILABLE, stored with the Attribution in the Analysis snapshot
with rulesVersion activity-1 and the threshold in use (D23-011)
reopening the report never fetches again (D23-001); <<#palegreen>>
stop

@enduml
